     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hey #R Folks!<div><br></div><div>Check out the upcoming CA Water Data Challenge. Consider registering (it&#39;s free) and a good opportunity to play/wrangle with data and visualization!</div><div><br></div><div>Adios,</div><div>Ryan<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">---------- Forwarded message ---------<br>From: <strong class=\"gmail_sendername\" dir=\"auto\">Rich Pauloo</strong> <span dir=\"auto\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rpa...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Thu, Aug 13, 2020 at 10:59 AM<br>Subject: [dsiaffiliates] [NEXT WEEK] Register for the 2020 California Water Data Challenge<br>To:  &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dsiaff...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br></div><br><br><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><div>Contrary to what you may think, you don&#39;t need a hydrology background to participate, but data chops are a must. </div><div><br></div><div>The datathon is a great way to meet people, apply data science skills to existing problems, and potentially win one of 10 $1500 cash prizes.</div><div><br></div><div>The first datathon is next week Aug 18-19, and <a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/datathon-the-5th-annual-ca-water-data-summit-and-water-solutions-5-registration-111690603602\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.eventbrite.com/e/datathon-the-5th-annual-ca-water-data-summit-and-water-solutions-5-registration-111690603602&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465350896000&amp;usg=AOvVaw18bA3y64TcRMMExSsZxjfz\">registration</a> can be found at this link.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Rich</div></div><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-size:small\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Rich Pauloo</font></span></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><i style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></font></i></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><i style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">PhD Candidate, </font><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Hydrologic Sciences<div style=\"display:inline\">  |  </div></span></i><i style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">University of California Davis</i><i style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"></span></i></div><div><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:19.5px;margin:0.1pt 0cm;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Tel: <a href=\"tel:(415)%20275-4981\" value=\"+14152754981\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(415) 275-4981</a></span></p><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:19.5px;margin:0.1pt 0cm;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://richpauloo.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://richpauloo.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465350896000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1W2lnj8GV-gaYV_dCY6uJx\">richpauloo.com</a></span></p><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:19.5px;margin:0.1pt 0cm;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></span></p>